      "display-alt": "\"ITC Clearface Std\", \"ITC Clearface\", \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif"
    },
    "viewport": {
      "compact": 375,
      "expanded": 1280
    },
    "$typeScale": "Type sizes step in 3s; multiples of 9 carry most of the system, and 6, 12, 15, 21 are valid in-between steps; 144 and 180 are poster sizes for one-off display moments. Spacing stays on 9."
